sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Chargewire server
  C->>S: POST …/statements<br/>Accept: application/vnd.apache.arrow.stream
  S-->>C: 200, Chargewire-Statement-Id:<br/>schema, batch 0, batch 1, …
  Note over S: the statement fails<br/>at row 3,000,000
  S--xC: the body ends WITHOUT<br/>the end-of-stream marker
  Note over C: incomplete stream:<br/>the result failed
  C->>S: GET …/statements/{statement_id}
  S-->>C: 200 {"state": "failed",<br/>"error": {"code": "execution_error", …}}
